  "text": "Adding custom pharmacy entries and updating patient favorites\n\nHello,\n\nI am hoping to get some guidance on how we can manage our pharmacy listings in the system. One of our patients, L.M., informed us today that their usual pharmacy has permanently shut down, and we need to update their profile with a new location. I tried searching for the newly opened compounding pharmacy nearby in the integrated directory, but it does not seem to appear in the search results at all. \n\nIs there a way for us to manually add a custom pharmacy entry into the directory so we can route prescriptions there properly? I looked through the settings menu under administration and couldn't find an obvious button for it. Any instructions you can provide would be greatly appreciated.\n\nThank you,\nDr. Vance"
